1
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:35,519
Jiaojiao,

2
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:37,439
do you remember who I am?

3
00:01:37,599 --> 00:01:38,400
What about me?

4
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:40,079
I'm your first escort.

5
00:01:40,760 --> 00:01:42,760
I just can't remember some things.

6
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:43,640
I'm not stupid.

7
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,840
How could I not remember you?

8
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,560
You left the Escort Agency without a word,

9
00:01:49,799 --> 00:01:50,879
and got hurt so badly.

10
00:01:51,359 --> 00:01:52,359
Grandpa was worried sick.

11
00:01:53,439 --> 00:01:54,280
Is he okay?

12
00:01:54,319 --> 00:01:55,079
How's the Escort Agency?

13
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,159
Except for no business,

14
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:58,400
everything else is fine.

15
00:02:01,719 --> 00:02:03,359
Brother, let's go home and take care of you.

16
00:02:03,879 --> 00:02:04,599
I can't leave yet.

17
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:05,920
I need to find out

18
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:07,359
the whole story of this fake escort mission.

19
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,800
Otherwise, the Agency won't get better.

20
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,319
I'm too slow to investigate alone.

21
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:11,680
Bai was taken away.

22
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,759
You can help me.

23
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:13,680
Bai Yanli?

24
00:02:15,879 --> 00:02:16,719
It's good that he was caught.

25
00:02:16,879 --> 00:02:17,719
If it weren't for him,

26
00:02:17,879 --> 00:02:18,960
the Escort Agency wouldn't be like this.

27
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:20,840
My Lady,

28
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,479
are you sure he didn't take the goods?

29
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,719
Bai has fought with bandits

30
00:02:24,919 --> 00:02:25,800
and saved my life.

31
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:27,199
It can't be him.

32
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,240
It's hard to say.

33
00:02:29,639 --> 00:02:31,080
He has a crush on you.

34
00:02:31,319 --> 00:02:32,599
What if he set up the whole thing

35
00:02:32,759 --> 00:02:33,840
to play the hero?

36
00:02:34,639 --> 00:02:35,840
Stop thinking about that.

37
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,919
You'd better take more escort missions.

38
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:38,800
Jiaojiao is right.

39
00:02:39,599 --> 00:02:41,080
Don't bother with Cheng Qi.

40
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:42,560
Just focus on the escort agency.

41
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:53,000
It seems that my wife doesn't remember you.

42
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,280
She's still mad at me.

43
00:02:56,319 --> 00:02:57,080
Feifei said

44
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,879
when a woman is angry, you should coax her.

45
00:02:59,639 --> 00:03:00,759
Do I need to know this?

46
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:01,879
Do you have an idea?

47
00:03:06,599 --> 00:03:07,599
Why are you still here?

48
00:03:07,919 --> 00:03:09,400
Do you think that kick wasn't hard enough?

49
00:03:11,919 --> 00:03:13,120
My dear, I was wrong.

50
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:14,039
I was wrong about everything.

51
00:03:14,199 --> 00:03:15,680
I'll never make you angry again.

52
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,360
Who is your dear?

53
00:03:21,479 --> 00:03:22,240
Are you looking for a beating?

54
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,000
It's me, my dear.

55
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:24,520
Who is your wife?

56
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:25,439
It's me.

57
00:03:25,439 --> 00:03:26,280
Are you looking for a beating?

58
00:03:26,319 --> 00:03:26,840
My lady, my lady.

59
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:27,199
Let me see you.

60
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,000
I am Cheng Qi.

61
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:28,800
What Cheng Qi?

62
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:29,800
I'll teach you not to talk nonsense.

63
00:03:29,919 --> 00:03:31,039
Stop, stop.

64
00:03:31,199 --> 00:03:31,680
Stop.

65
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:32,800
Who is your wife?

66
00:03:34,639 --> 00:03:35,240
My dear,

67
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:38,000
if beating me can make you feel better,

68
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,039
then beat me to death.

69
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,199
Beat you to death?

70
00:03:53,479 --> 00:03:54,719
Such a good thing,

71
00:03:55,039 --> 00:03:56,319
why not leave it to me?

72
00:03:58,520 --> 00:03:59,840
He will really kill me.

73
00:04:00,039 --> 00:04:00,879
Jiao, save me.

74
00:04:01,159 --> 00:04:01,960
Jiao,

75
00:04:14,439 --> 00:04:15,360
she almost died

76
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,639
because of you.

77
00:04:16,639 --> 00:04:17,839
I don't care what others think,

78
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:19,480
but you...

79
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,839
I never intended to hurt her.

80
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:21,800
Neither did I.

81
00:04:22,279 --> 00:04:24,000
But you're going to divorce her.

82
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,199
You broke her heart.

83
00:04:25,519 --> 00:04:25,959
Hello?

84
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:47,399
Can I kill someone in your yard?

85
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:48,560
As you wish.

86
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,439
As long as you are happy.

87
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:55,360
You just know how to dodge.

88
00:04:55,519 --> 00:04:56,680
Fight me face to face.

89
00:04:56,839 --> 00:04:58,000
Jiao hasn't forgiven me yet.

90
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,160
I can't just die like this.

91
00:05:07,079 --> 00:05:07,839
Cheng Qi.

92
00:05:08,519 --> 00:05:10,000
I won't let you meet her again.

93
00:05:10,759 --> 00:05:11,519
He is Cheng Qi.

94
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,279
Save him.

95
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,120
Cheng Qi is not a good person.

96
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,560
Do you think if you kill him,

97
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:23,040
you can be with Su Yuejiao?

98
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,759
That's not what I thought.

99
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,560
You are a fugitive in the Yun State.

100
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:28,079
You and Su Yuejiao have no chance.

101
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,560
I can take her back to Langyue.

102
00:05:29,839 --> 00:05:31,680
In Langyue, you have to be my consort.

103
00:05:31,959 --> 00:05:33,480
Otherwise, your enemy won't let you go.

104
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:36,120
Your family has guarded Langyue for generations.

105
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,800
You are the most proud wolf.

106
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:42,399
You have the noblest blood in Langyue.

107
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,879
You are no longer a fugitive.

108
00:05:45,439 --> 00:05:48,000
It's your responsibility to restore the glory of your family.

109
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,920
How do you know all this?

110
00:05:55,879 --> 00:05:57,639
Because you are my man.

111
00:05:58,399 --> 00:05:59,399
You wouldn't forget

112
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,759
our engagement, would you?

113
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:04,480
You are...

114
00:06:05,279 --> 00:06:06,160
Princess?

115
00:06:07,319 --> 00:06:08,879
I'll help you get back the wolf badge.

116
00:06:29,319 --> 00:06:30,480
Damn it!

117
00:06:31,079 --> 00:06:32,439
I almost died here.

118
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,920
If my father knows,

119
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:35,800
he will beat me to death.

120
00:06:36,639 --> 00:06:37,240
My Lord,

121
00:06:37,839 --> 00:06:39,319
isn't that the same meaning?

122
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:41,199
How could it be the same?

123
00:06:41,519 --> 00:06:43,000
My father wouldn't let me die,

124
00:06:43,399 --> 00:06:44,439
and neither would my wife.

125
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:47,040
But others might not be so kind.

126
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:51,279
But my lady doesn't remember you anymore.

127
00:06:52,439 --> 00:06:53,279
I don't know.

128
00:06:54,079 --> 00:06:55,040
It's hard to say.

129
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:57,680
Easy.

130
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:02,759
It's actually a good thing.

131
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,000
I did

132
00:07:05,279 --> 00:07:06,879
some bad things before.

133
00:07:06,879 --> 00:07:08,079
I hurt her deeply.

134
00:07:08,519 --> 00:07:10,120
It's better for her to forget me

135
00:07:10,639 --> 00:07:11,480
and know me again.

136
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,600
Are you going to be a playboy?

137
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:14,759
What if she

138
00:07:14,759 --> 00:07:15,879
suddenly remembers?

139
00:07:15,879 --> 00:07:16,680
You'd better

140
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:18,519
stop talking nonsense.

141
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:22,680
So,

142
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,360
we need to change the way.

143
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,279
I checked the goods before setting out.

144
00:07:29,839 --> 00:07:31,560
It turned into a stone for no reason.

145
00:07:31,839 --> 00:07:32,519
The problem

146
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:34,720
should be found from the person who sent the goods.

147
00:07:35,639 --> 00:07:37,480
This is the border between the Yun State and the Langyue State.

148
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,519
Since you are asked to deliver the goods here,

149
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:41,199
the person is likely to be in the city.

150
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,279
Do you remember what he looks like?

151
00:07:44,399 --> 00:07:45,319
Let's split up and look for him.

152
00:07:45,839 --> 00:07:46,680
I don't remember clearly.

153
00:07:47,639 --> 00:07:49,800
But I might remember if I see him.

154
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:52,639
I just remember he has a big beard.

155
00:07:59,519 --> 00:08:00,160
Mr. Su,

156
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:03,759
how dare you come here?

157
00:08:04,759 --> 00:08:06,000
I'm here

158
00:08:06,199 --> 00:08:07,639
to ask you to take a mission.

159
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:08,720
I'm sorry.

160
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:09,959
We don't take missions now.

161
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:14,000
I heard that you never refuse any order.

162
00:08:14,319 --> 00:08:15,399
Is that a rumor?

163
00:08:15,839 --> 00:08:16,759
I'll go and clarify it.

164
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:18,480
What kind of escort

165
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:19,920
do you want?

166
00:08:24,839 --> 00:08:26,920
I broke my leg recently.

167
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:29,759
I need escorts to accompany me to go shopping.

168
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,279
I need three escorts.

169
00:08:38,799 --> 00:08:39,720
You must be there.

170
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:42,960
Here's the deposit.

171
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,360
Then tomorrow at dawn,

172
00:08:45,759 --> 00:08:46,960
we'll be waiting.

173
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,320
Farewell.

174
00:08:59,519 --> 00:09:01,559
Will he even get up that early?

175
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:03,919
There are so many weirdos in this city.

176
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:07,080
Tomorrow, while accompanying him,

177
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,879
we'll split up and inquire

178
00:09:08,879 --> 00:09:09,840
about the whereabouts of that Lang Yue.

179
00:09:15,399 --> 00:09:15,960
My Lord,

180
00:09:16,519 --> 00:09:17,840
why must we leave so early?

181
00:09:18,679 --> 00:09:21,080
Getting up early shows diligence.

182
00:09:23,039 --> 00:09:24,120
But you look so sleepy.

183
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,399
Lady Shen is not blind.

184
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,159
I'm not sleepy.

185
00:09:27,799 --> 00:09:29,399
I'm full of energy.

186
00:09:33,759 --> 00:09:35,039
I'll follow him to the market.

187
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,759
You two go to the courier station and the escort team.

188
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,440
If you encounter them, don't fight.

189
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,519
If there's no news,

190
00:09:39,759 --> 00:09:41,240
meet at the rouge shop at the end of the street.

191
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,759
Go shopping with me.

192
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:02,519
No.

193
00:10:04,039 --> 00:10:05,720
Su Yuejiao can go shopping with Cheng Qi.

194
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:07,000
Why can't you go with me?

195
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:08,480
Go.

196
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,600
You can't go out like this.

197
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:12,720
Change him.

198
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:13,480
Yes.

199
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:19,639
What are you doing?

200
00:10:19,919 --> 00:10:21,000
Stop, stop.

201
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,759
No, stop, no, stop.

202
00:10:23,799 --> 00:10:24,840
I'll do it myself.

203
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:26,840
Zhalu.

204
00:10:29,039 --> 00:10:29,559
No, no, no.

205
00:10:41,759 --> 00:10:44,639
Excuse me, have you seen a bearded merchant from Langyue?

206
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,600
There are many bearded merchants from Langyue.

207
00:10:46,759 --> 00:10:48,320
It's hard to find the one you want.

208
00:10:48,639 --> 00:10:50,480
What are you looking for?

209
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,960
Just asking.

210
00:10:53,159 --> 00:10:55,080
Don't worry, I won't waste your time.

211
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,120
If you want to buy something,

212
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:56,919
just tell me.

213
00:10:57,159 --> 00:10:57,960
You can buy

214
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,159
whenever you want.

215
00:10:59,159 --> 00:10:59,720
How about

216
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:00,919
I help you find him?

217
00:11:01,639 --> 00:11:03,240
You can get your money back

218
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:04,120
if you don't want to go on.

219
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,320
The escort fee can be returned to you at a discount.

220
00:11:06,799 --> 00:11:08,559
I'd rather go shopping.

221
00:11:09,039 --> 00:11:09,399
By the way,

222
00:11:10,159 --> 00:11:11,000
this blanket

223
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:11,919
is of good quality.

224
00:11:11,919 --> 00:11:13,240
I believe you must like it.

225
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:14,039
It's for you.

226
00:11:14,159 --> 00:11:14,799
I don't like it.

227
00:11:15,639 --> 00:11:17,440
This is a specialty of Langyue Lake.

228
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,759
Young man, don't you think so?

229
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:20,639
No.

230
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:22,600
Just take it.

231
00:11:22,799 --> 00:11:24,639
Young man, except this,

232
00:11:24,759 --> 00:11:26,519
what other specialties does this city have?

233
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:42,080
There's no errand today.

234
00:11:44,519 --> 00:11:45,919
Although they are divorced,

235
00:11:46,159 --> 00:11:46,919
but

236
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,840
I should still give them

237
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:49,799
the final episode.

238
00:11:51,159 --> 00:11:52,519
Don't be so upset.

239
00:11:53,039 --> 00:11:56,159
Cheng Jiao's story is far from over.

240
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:01,759
Is it really okay

241
00:12:02,039 --> 00:12:02,919
to let her take those things?

242
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:04,279
She's a bodyguard after all.

243
00:12:04,559 --> 00:12:06,120
And those things are all for her.

244
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:06,600
It's okay.

245
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,720
My Lord, stop buying.

246
00:12:09,039 --> 00:12:10,159
We don't have much money left.

247
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:13,639
Don't you have private money?

248
00:12:13,759 --> 00:12:14,679
Use your money first.

249
00:12:14,759 --> 00:12:15,639
I'll pay you back later.

250
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:16,960
Let's go.

251
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:21,720
Boss

252
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:22,799
Two bags of chestnuts, please.

253
00:12:22,919 --> 00:12:23,480
Okay.

254
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:24,960
Thank you.

255
00:12:32,039 --> 00:12:32,600
Ms. Su

256
00:12:32,679 --> 00:12:33,559
This is really delicious.

257
00:12:33,639 --> 00:12:34,120
Try it.

258
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:35,960
Let's go.

259
00:12:39,759 --> 00:12:41,159
Turn around and see if she's eaten it.

260
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:45,639
Yes, she has.

261
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:51,000
Really?

262
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:00,799
Excuse me,

263
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:01,799
I'd like to know

264
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:04,279
if your shop has business dealings with Yunjing.

265
00:13:04,559 --> 00:13:06,360
Our main store is indeed in Yunjing,

266
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:08,200
but the rouge is from Pingjiang.

267
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,840
The rouge from Pingjiang, the powder from Guangling.

268
00:13:12,039 --> 00:13:14,039
Why do you suddenly use rouge?

269
00:13:16,159 --> 00:13:17,240
What?

270
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:20,120
The rouge from Pingjiang, the powder from Guangling.

271
00:13:20,759 --> 00:13:21,919
Someone told me.

272
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:23,759
You are an expert.

273
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:25,679
Is your boss from Langyue?

274
00:13:26,039 --> 00:13:28,279
Or has any business dealings with Langyue?

275
00:13:28,519 --> 00:13:29,919
This is a shop in the Yun State.

276
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:31,080
The boss surnamed Zhang.

277
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:33,120
There are many customers from Langyue.

278
00:13:34,279 --> 00:13:34,960
How about this?

279
00:13:35,399 --> 00:13:36,080
I'll

280
00:13:36,159 --> 00:13:37,919
draw the person you're looking for.

281
00:13:38,559 --> 00:13:39,879
You've seen a lot of people.

282
00:13:40,039 --> 00:13:41,720
Maybe you'll remember him after seeing this.

283
00:13:44,639 --> 00:13:46,480
Could you please lend me a pen and paper?

284
00:13:50,360 --> 00:13:50,960
How about it?

285
00:13:53,039 --> 00:13:54,279
It should be.

286
00:13:54,879 --> 00:13:56,120
I can't remember clearly.

287
00:13:57,559 --> 00:13:58,399
What about the shopkeeper?

288
00:13:58,519 --> 00:13:59,279
Do you have any impression?

289
00:14:00,399 --> 00:14:01,000
No.

290
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:04,720
I remember.

291
00:14:04,960 --> 00:14:06,240
He wore a brown agate bead string

292
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:08,120
on his left wrist.

293
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:11,440
Agate bead string.

294
00:14:14,759 --> 00:14:15,360
This time,

295
00:14:19,159 --> 00:14:21,320
I'll ask the painter to draw a few more.

296
00:14:21,759 --> 00:14:22,759
I'll look for him with the portrait.

297
00:14:23,279 --> 00:14:24,080
I don't believe

298
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:25,799
no one in the whole city has seen him.

299
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:28,480
I've said

300
00:14:28,519 --> 00:14:30,200
I'll take care of finding him.

301
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:45,919
I didn't expect it to be quite exotic.

302
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:48,320
You really have a good taste.

303
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,080
Princess.

304
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,759
Except for Langyue,

305
00:14:54,639 --> 00:14:55,759
have you ever seen

306
00:14:55,879 --> 00:14:57,759
such a pompous woman in the Yun State?

307
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:01,919
Who painted this?

308
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:05,799
Princess, do you know this person?

309
00:15:06,559 --> 00:15:07,159
Yes.

310
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:08,600
I can find him.

311
00:15:09,559 --> 00:15:11,240
He likes beautiful women and good wine,

312
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:12,600
and likes the poetry of Cheng Qi.

313
00:15:12,799 --> 00:15:14,039
Beautiful women, good wine, and you,

314
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:15,519
he will definitely appear.

315
00:15:21,159 --> 00:15:21,799
Miss,

316
00:15:22,279 --> 00:15:23,720
there's news about Cheng Qi.

317
00:15:24,759 --> 00:15:25,799
He has returned to Yunjing.

318
00:15:26,279 --> 00:15:28,519
He will perform poetry at a banquet in the city of Klax.

319
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:29,639
Who set the banquet?

320
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:32,039
It seems to be the princess of Langyue.

321
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:36,720
No wonder there's an extra Xiangyue Tower

322
00:15:37,399 --> 00:15:39,360
and frequent purchases of poetry books.

323
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:41,440
It turns out he met a noble.

324
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:43,279
Should we

325
00:15:43,399 --> 00:15:45,559
send someone to keep an eye on him?

326
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:46,840
Forget it.

327
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:49,039
Since he's still writing poetry,

328
00:15:49,559 --> 00:15:50,440
he'll come across her sooner or later.

329
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:55,159
After everyone is seated,

330
00:15:55,399 --> 00:15:56,879
this can be the stage for the speech.

331
00:15:57,720 --> 00:15:58,720
As for the seating,

332
00:15:59,039 --> 00:16:00,240
the emperor's son-in-law and I will sit here.

333
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:03,120
You and Mr. Su will sit here.

334
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:06,360
That's good.

335
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:10,159
It's more convenient for me to get up and give a speech.

336
00:16:11,519 --> 00:16:12,759
Actually, you don't have to bother.

337
00:16:13,159 --> 00:16:14,080
Just tell me

338
00:16:14,279 --> 00:16:15,000
his name

339
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:18,120
or how to find him.

340
00:16:19,120 --> 00:16:20,279
His name is Arsal.

341
00:16:20,399 --> 00:16:21,879
He is a very powerful businessman in Langyue.

342
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:23,519
No one knows where he is.

343
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:25,200
But I'm sure

344
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:27,639
if he knows that Cheng Qi is coming to the banquet,

345
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:28,840
he will definitely appear.

346
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:32,200
I'm worried that if we don't get along,

347
00:16:32,559 --> 00:16:34,039
it may disturb the banquet.

348
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:35,080
It doesn't matter.

349
00:16:35,279 --> 00:16:36,799
No one can hurt you in my place.

350
00:16:37,759 --> 00:16:39,120
I will protect you.

351
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:42,799
Princess,

352
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:44,480
I've always been curious

353
00:16:44,879 --> 00:16:46,159
why you're so nice to me.

354
00:16:50,759 --> 00:16:51,919
This is your love story,

355
00:16:52,519 --> 00:16:54,039
and it's where I fell in love with you.

356
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:56,600
You can recall it.

357
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:02,159
Anyway,

358
00:17:02,759 --> 00:17:03,759
thank you, Princess.

359
00:17:04,039 --> 00:17:05,119
I'll try my best

360
00:17:05,279 --> 00:17:06,480
not to ruin Xiangyue Tower.

361
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:08,640
Mr. Su,

362
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:10,319
I'll take my leave now.

363
00:17:21,599 --> 00:17:22,279
Princess.

364
00:17:24,519 --> 00:17:25,720
I have to keep this painting.

365
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:27,920
I'll give it to my wife.

366
00:17:28,359 --> 00:17:29,559
I'm sorry to make you suffer.

367
00:17:30,119 --> 00:17:30,960
But

368
00:17:31,319 --> 00:17:32,960
you look heroic in the portrait.

369
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:33,759
You're a hero.

370
00:17:36,559 --> 00:17:37,440
For Langyue,

371
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:38,720
it doesn't matter.

372
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:41,119
You're right.

373
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:43,480
Yikeba colluded with Yunjing.

374
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:46,000
As long as it's not escorted by the Fuyun Escort Agency,

375
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:48,519
it will be robbed by his men.

376
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,240
As expected.

377
00:17:51,799 --> 00:17:52,559
But I told you

378
00:17:52,559 --> 00:17:54,200
to protect Su Yuejiao after the order.

379
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:55,599
How did she get hurt?

380
00:17:57,039 --> 00:17:58,839
We followed her out of Yunjing.

381
00:17:59,160 --> 00:18:00,920
But the emperor's son-in-law appeared halfway.

382
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:02,559
We can't get too close to them,

383
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:05,279
and can't let the robbers recognize us.

384
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:08,559
Finally, we came up with a way to lure them away.

385
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:09,759
Forget it.

386
00:18:10,599 --> 00:18:13,000
They are made for each other.

387
00:18:13,160 --> 00:18:13,920
Even if they forget,

388
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:15,000
they will fall in love again.

389
00:18:15,839 --> 00:18:17,200
How did Yikeba react

390
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:18,240
when he knew I would hold a banquet

391
00:18:18,279 --> 00:18:18,960
for Cheng Qi?

392
00:18:20,799 --> 00:18:22,000
He's a little soft.

393
00:18:22,160 --> 00:18:24,039
He just mocked the Princess a little.

394
00:18:25,799 --> 00:18:27,519
Find a way to get him to the banquet.

395
00:18:27,759 --> 00:18:29,160
I want him to see

396
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:32,319
how I do for Cheng Qi.

397
00:18:33,319 --> 00:18:35,319
Should I avoid him?

398
00:18:35,319 --> 00:18:35,920
No.

399
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:37,519
It's time for him

400
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:39,079
to meet an old friend.

401
00:18:40,319 --> 00:18:41,359
Yes, Your Highness.

402
00:18:48,839 --> 00:18:49,319
Wait.

403
00:18:52,519 --> 00:18:53,960
Don't you like reading scripts?

404
00:18:54,079 --> 00:18:55,680
I think Gong Xi writes well.

405
00:18:56,559 --> 00:18:57,599
My brother and Fachaibo

406
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:59,880
have told me about us.

407
00:19:01,559 --> 00:19:02,359
I...

408
00:19:03,960 --> 00:19:05,720
I don't really want to divorce you.

409
00:19:06,759 --> 00:19:07,880
It's to save the Escort Agency.

410
00:19:08,240 --> 00:19:08,759
Right?

411
00:19:10,079 --> 00:19:11,440
I know it's not the reason.

412
00:19:13,599 --> 00:19:15,920
It's because of what I said at the Grand Preceptor's Villa

413
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:18,160
hurt your feelings.

414
00:19:20,759 --> 00:19:21,359
But

415
00:19:21,559 --> 00:19:22,960
if I didn't say that,

416
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:25,200
Zhang Xi Yun would definitely do something bad to you.

417
00:19:25,920 --> 00:19:27,359
Fortunately, everything is fine now.

418
00:19:27,359 --> 00:19:28,160
Mr. Cheng,

419
00:19:29,119 --> 00:19:30,440
I don't remember some things.

420
00:19:31,759 --> 00:19:33,160
Whatever we had before,

421
00:19:33,359 --> 00:19:34,920
I just want to guard the Escort Agency.

422
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:36,440
Then I'll guard it with you,

423
00:19:37,359 --> 00:19:38,440
just like before.

424
00:19:38,559 --> 00:19:39,200
Mr. Cheng,

425
00:19:39,799 --> 00:19:41,480
you're involved in too much trouble.

426
00:19:42,039 --> 00:19:44,000
I don't want the Agency to suffer with you.

427
00:19:45,119 --> 00:19:46,599
Thank you for painting for me.

428
00:19:46,759 --> 00:19:49,319
From now on, we're just employer and employee.

429
00:19:49,559 --> 00:19:50,559
You give me the order,

430
00:19:50,680 --> 00:19:51,440
and I'll give you a discount.

431
00:20:20,559 --> 00:20:21,279
Thank you.

432
00:20:21,279 --> 00:20:21,960
Thank you.

433
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:23,519
Sign here.

434
00:20:23,519 --> 00:20:24,559
Mr. Cheng, please sign for me.

435
00:20:24,559 --> 00:20:25,160
It's my turn.

436
00:20:25,160 --> 00:20:26,160
I want one, too.

437
00:20:35,319 --> 00:20:36,799
I didn't expect Cheng Qi

438
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:38,279
to be so popular in the city of Klara.

439
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:41,279
I should bring some of Gong Xi's words next time.

440
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:42,759
Good idea.

441
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:46,519
Thank you.

442
00:20:51,759 --> 00:20:53,319
Cheng Qi is really talented.

443
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:55,119
Let him go like this,

444
00:20:55,319 --> 00:20:56,480
don't you feel it's a pity?

445
00:20:57,559 --> 00:20:58,759
I run a escort agency.

446
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:00,279
It's more important to know martial arts.

447
00:21:02,640 --> 00:21:03,839
You've always thought that?

448
00:21:04,240 --> 00:21:06,319
Then why did you fall in love with him before?

449
00:21:06,799 --> 00:21:08,839
Is it because he's handsome?

450
00:21:09,799 --> 00:21:10,400
Princess,

451
00:21:10,599 --> 00:21:12,079
if you like him, just do it.

452
00:21:12,519 --> 00:21:13,920
Don't force us together.

453
00:21:34,440 --> 00:21:35,799
It seems that your method

454
00:21:36,200 --> 00:21:37,079
is not very effective.

455
00:21:38,039 --> 00:21:40,640
I want her to see that many people like you.

456
00:21:41,119 --> 00:21:42,519
She doesn't like poetry.

457
00:21:44,960 --> 00:21:46,400
You really know her.

458
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:48,640
By the way,

459
00:21:49,119 --> 00:21:50,400
why is there no bookstore here?

460
00:21:50,759 --> 00:21:53,000
The books they hold are all different.

461
00:21:53,559 --> 00:21:54,599
It's a mess.

462
00:21:54,839 --> 00:21:56,960
Those books were smuggled from Yunjing.

463
00:21:56,960 --> 00:21:57,799
They are in short supply.

464
00:21:58,559 --> 00:21:59,839
So many people can't buy them.

465
00:21:59,839 --> 00:22:01,440
They can only copy and print them by themselves.

466
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:03,039
If we can trade,

467
00:22:03,119 --> 00:22:04,440
your books will be sold well

468
00:22:04,519 --> 00:22:05,440
here and in

469
00:22:05,440 --> 00:22:06,519
Langyue.

470
00:22:10,839 --> 00:22:11,480
Father,

471
00:22:13,960 --> 00:22:15,799
Ling Feng has finished the work.

472
00:22:16,519 --> 00:22:17,519
Good job.

473
00:22:19,200 --> 00:22:22,039
Establish your authority slowly,

474
00:22:22,599 --> 00:22:24,279
and you'll be ready for the future.

475
00:22:27,240 --> 00:22:27,880
Father,

476
00:22:28,720 --> 00:22:30,640
there's something I've been confused about.

477
00:22:31,200 --> 00:22:32,200
You want to know

478
00:22:32,599 --> 00:22:35,680
why the Star Conference didn't let you take over directly.

479
00:22:37,640 --> 00:22:39,359
You really can't hide anything from you.

480
00:22:39,559 --> 00:22:41,319
Not just the Star Conference,

481
00:22:41,759 --> 00:22:43,319
but also the shops with money transactions.

482
00:22:43,559 --> 00:22:45,119
Why are they all given to that girl?

483
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:49,000
To achieve great things, one must know how to use others.

484
00:22:49,960 --> 00:22:51,759
If you take the lead,

485
00:22:51,799 --> 00:22:52,799
who will cover for you

486
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:54,759
if something goes wrong?

487
00:23:01,799 --> 00:23:02,880
But...

488
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:06,160
Everything in the Zhang family will be yours in the future.

489
00:23:06,640 --> 00:23:08,640
I must plan well for you.

490
00:23:09,400 --> 00:23:10,279
As for you,

491
00:23:10,720 --> 00:23:12,920
just collect profits with clean hands.

492
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:14,559
No need to get your hands dirty.

493
00:23:15,400 --> 00:23:16,839
Leave the dirty work

494
00:23:17,759 --> 00:23:19,200
to someone else.

495
00:23:19,480 --> 00:23:20,119
Alright.

496
00:23:20,480 --> 00:23:21,400
I understand.

497
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:12,960
Good.

498
00:24:14,920 --> 00:24:15,839
Good.

499
00:24:20,599 --> 00:24:21,319
I don't drink

500
00:24:21,319 --> 00:24:22,160
wine.

501
00:24:22,720 --> 00:24:23,279
This

502
00:24:23,359 --> 00:24:24,680
is specially prepared for you.

503
00:24:24,880 --> 00:24:26,039
Langyue's grape juice.

504
00:24:26,279 --> 00:24:26,680
Don't worry.

505
00:24:28,720 --> 00:24:29,319
My Lord.

506
00:24:29,680 --> 00:24:31,519
It seems that the idea of the Princess

507
00:24:32,200 --> 00:24:34,039
to find the people of Langyue is not feasible.

508
00:24:35,640 --> 00:24:37,200
If we can't even find the Princess,

509
00:24:37,359 --> 00:24:38,559
we'd better go back quickly.

510
00:24:39,279 --> 00:24:40,119
I'm worried that my grandfather

511
00:24:40,480 --> 00:24:41,599
is annoyed by my uncle.

512
00:24:48,559 --> 00:24:52,160
It's been a long time since the house was so quiet.

513
00:24:52,759 --> 00:24:53,759
I miss My Lord.

514
00:24:54,400 --> 00:24:55,400
I want to make a fortune.

515
00:25:00,759 --> 00:25:01,440
All you know is eating.

516
00:25:01,440 --> 00:25:02,519
You're always eating.

517
00:25:04,319 --> 00:25:05,880
Aren't you worried?

518
00:25:06,599 --> 00:25:08,079
Their kong fu is better than mine.

519
00:25:08,400 --> 00:25:09,640
I can't do anything about it.

520
00:25:10,519 --> 00:25:11,599
Since they're fine,

521
00:25:11,960 --> 00:25:14,039
they'll come back to eat with me sooner or later.

522
00:25:15,200 --> 00:25:17,039
I should eat more.

523
00:25:18,119 --> 00:25:18,920
Right, dad?

524
00:25:22,160 --> 00:25:23,279
Go ahead.

525
00:25:27,920 --> 00:25:31,319
Clouds cross the desert, sky is vast.

526
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:35,279
Wine overflows, banquet is warm.

527
00:25:36,160 --> 00:25:39,359
Deep gratitude for the journey.

528
00:25:39,559 --> 00:25:43,200
Mountains and rivers, all are joyful.

529
00:26:25,279 --> 00:26:26,359
It's him!

530
00:26:26,880 --> 00:26:27,680
I'll kill him!

531
00:26:29,359 --> 00:26:30,559
As a warrior of Lang Yue,

532
00:26:30,920 --> 00:26:32,079
you need to be brave and strategic.

533
00:26:32,680 --> 00:26:33,400
Stay calm.

534
00:26:33,839 --> 00:26:34,720
I have a plan.

535
00:26:40,759 --> 00:26:41,440
Princess,

536
00:26:42,279 --> 00:26:43,559
you have a new favorite.

537
00:26:44,119 --> 00:26:45,319
Didn't you like

538
00:26:45,559 --> 00:26:47,279
the writer from the Yun State?

539
00:26:48,559 --> 00:26:49,319
General,

540
00:26:50,079 --> 00:26:50,799
he is

541
00:26:51,319 --> 00:26:53,319
the top poet of the Yun State,

542
00:26:54,359 --> 00:26:56,039
the poet you like.

543
00:27:01,079 --> 00:27:02,440
Are you Cheng Qi?

544
00:27:11,720 --> 00:27:12,680
Yes, I am.

545
00:27:13,400 --> 00:27:15,920
But I have stepped down from the top spot.

546
00:27:16,440 --> 00:27:17,839
I just like writing poems.

547
00:27:18,880 --> 00:27:20,119
What are you saying?

548
00:27:21,319 --> 00:27:22,200
Take him away.

549
00:27:22,319 --> 00:27:23,200
Yes, yes.

550
00:27:25,200 --> 00:27:26,200
What are you doing?

551
00:27:33,240 --> 00:27:34,240
Princess likes him.

552
00:27:34,680 --> 00:27:35,440
I'll help Princess

553
00:27:35,960 --> 00:27:37,160
bring him to Langyue.

554
00:27:37,160 --> 00:27:38,519
This is the border city of the Yun State.

555
00:27:41,480 --> 00:27:43,119
I'm also a citizen of the Yun State.

556
00:27:43,559 --> 00:27:45,440
Please be careful.

557
00:27:45,920 --> 00:27:46,759
Yikeba,

558
00:27:47,319 --> 00:27:48,319
I invited you here to drink,

559
00:27:48,319 --> 00:27:49,160
not to cause trouble.

560
00:27:49,440 --> 00:27:51,119
You've ruined my good mood.

561
00:27:53,799 --> 00:27:55,279
Don't be angry.

562
00:27:55,440 --> 00:27:57,839
The general prepared beautiful women

563
00:27:58,359 --> 00:28:00,240
and good wine for you to make you happy.

564
00:28:00,279 --> 00:28:02,160
If you want to use it, just sit down.

565
00:28:33,960 --> 00:28:35,519
Thank you for protecting me.

566
00:28:36,599 --> 00:28:37,119
I...

567
00:28:38,519 --> 00:28:39,759
I didn't do that for you.

568
00:28:40,160 --> 00:28:41,119
You're from Yun State.

569
00:28:41,200 --> 00:28:43,039
You can't be bullied by Langyue people.

570
00:28:44,920 --> 00:28:45,759
Yes, yes, yes.

571
00:28:46,480 --> 00:28:47,319
You're right.

572
00:28:53,279 --> 00:28:54,000
Your Majesty,

573
00:28:55,319 --> 00:28:58,880
the amount of construction in and around

574
00:28:59,240 --> 00:29:02,000
Kala Town and Yunjing has suddenly increased,

575
00:29:02,319 --> 00:29:03,759
and the treasury has been depleted.

576
00:29:04,559 --> 00:29:05,480
At the same time,

577
00:29:05,680 --> 00:29:08,279
the prices in these places have also risen.

578
00:29:08,559 --> 00:29:10,359
Merchants have raised prices,

579
00:29:10,440 --> 00:29:13,119
but the wages of the people

580
00:29:13,440 --> 00:29:14,359
remain unchanged.

581
00:29:16,039 --> 00:29:17,480
But no one

582
00:29:17,720 --> 00:29:20,359
mentioned these in the court today.

583
00:29:22,960 --> 00:29:24,240
Do you think

584
00:29:24,480 --> 00:29:26,000
someone did it on purpose?

585
00:29:27,039 --> 00:29:28,079
I think

586
00:29:28,640 --> 00:29:30,119
they can't wait

587
00:29:30,559 --> 00:29:31,680
to reap the benefits.

588
00:29:36,400 --> 00:29:38,400
It's not just this.

589
00:29:39,039 --> 00:29:39,640
Look at

590
00:29:47,640 --> 00:29:49,960
Ling Feng's speech

591
00:29:50,880 --> 00:29:51,960
is smooth

592
00:29:52,640 --> 00:29:53,839
and well-structured.

593
00:29:54,880 --> 00:29:56,119
I'm waiting for that...

594
00:29:56,640 --> 00:29:57,279
But...

595
00:30:00,279 --> 00:30:01,119
But...

596
00:30:02,039 --> 00:30:03,240
But it's just a pile of words

597
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:04,759
with no real content.

598
00:30:07,160 --> 00:30:08,480
This speech

599
00:30:08,680 --> 00:30:10,759
is quite different from his previous ones.

600
00:30:11,359 --> 00:30:12,640
But to me,

601
00:30:12,720 --> 00:30:15,960
it resembles Mr. Ling's style.

602
00:30:17,839 --> 00:30:19,880
You're eager to make Ling Feng stand out.

603
00:30:20,680 --> 00:30:21,480
Cheng Qi,

604
00:30:21,839 --> 00:30:22,880
how long until we return to Yunjing?

605
00:30:23,079 --> 00:30:23,759
The report says

606
00:30:24,119 --> 00:30:27,480
Cheng Qi is writing for the actress at Xiangyue Tower.

607
00:30:27,680 --> 00:30:29,039
He'll return to the capital in a few days.

608
00:30:29,440 --> 00:30:31,160
He started performing early.

609
00:30:31,480 --> 00:30:34,160
Then I need to hurry up.

610
00:30:34,680 --> 00:30:36,440
I'll get on it right away.

611
00:30:41,079 --> 00:30:42,880
I don't know if he and Su Yuejiao

612
00:30:43,799 --> 00:30:45,119
have made up.

613
00:30:51,079 --> 00:30:52,759
If I want to catch him,

614
00:30:52,839 --> 00:30:54,160
I don't need you to do it.

615
00:30:54,480 --> 00:30:56,119
Writing lyrics needs a quiet place.

616
00:30:56,240 --> 00:30:57,240
You don't understand at all.

617
00:30:59,079 --> 00:31:00,240
I don't understand.

618
00:31:01,279 --> 00:31:01,880
For him,

619
00:31:02,759 --> 00:31:04,319
you're going to trade.

620
00:31:04,960 --> 00:31:06,880
These people from Yun State are very bad.

621
00:31:07,480 --> 00:31:09,680
They want our cattle, sheep and gems.

622
00:31:10,480 --> 00:31:12,480
You have so many cattle and gems,

623
00:31:12,480 --> 00:31:13,640
but you don't know how to enjoy them.

624
00:31:15,759 --> 00:31:16,880
Is the wine in Yunjing

625
00:31:16,880 --> 00:31:18,440
better than that in Langyue?

626
00:31:24,759 --> 00:31:26,240
Everything you like

627
00:31:26,480 --> 00:31:28,200
can be found in the city of Kla.

628
00:31:28,319 --> 00:31:29,160
I don't care.

629
00:31:29,359 --> 00:31:30,440
I just want to be the first to read

630
00:31:30,440 --> 00:31:31,920
Cheng Qi's books and poems.

631
00:31:32,240 --> 00:31:33,559
If you don't agree to trade,

632
00:31:33,680 --> 00:31:34,759
you have to find another way.

633
00:31:35,480 --> 00:31:37,640
Then we can find a fast courier agency

634
00:31:37,680 --> 00:31:39,160
to deliver the books for you.
